{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着実に\n全国ツアー初日が近づいてきておりますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おととい、\n私服からレッスン着に着替えてた時のお話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裏っ返しになった服の肩の部分って結構"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/31/6866097/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左の図みたいに\n布の切れ端的な感じでけぱけぱしてるじゃん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"処理してあってけぱけぱしてなくても\nだいたいは裏って感じじゃん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそのとき着てきてた服の肩の部分は\n裏なのに\n右の図みたいに\n表かのごとく処理されてたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田気づいちゃったのよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きな声で\n「あれ！この服リバーシブルだー！」\nって言ったのね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/31/6866097/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すると、近くにいた2期生ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/31/6866097/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「え、ここにタグが...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブランド名が書いてあるやつね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅はかだったよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/31/6866097/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちも出てたよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗濯表示とかのやつね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「でも切っちゃえば使えますよね！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って2期生のみんなが\nすごいフォローしてくれました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/31/6866097/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しいのう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/31/6866097/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}